  "m2_criterion": {
    "id": "M2_source_attested",
    "definition": "Current rights-cleared Myanmar Post seven-character string assignments with Quarter/Village Tract or explicit non-area scope, source identifiers, edition, validity, retrieval time, schema and SHA-256. Independently permitted geometry needs an explicit temporal assignment relation, reviewed CRS/topology and official/derived/virtual/none authority; absent geometry remains none without a spatial lookup claim. Reproducible real-record coverage, exception, privacy and transformation checks, approved immutable digest-pinned data artifacts and the actual AGID loader/API must all pass. Preserve leading zeroes, Myanmar-script names and separate MIMU administrative PCodes; house numbers and buildings require separate explicit permitted civic/building relations."
  },
